                                "sense_id": "2cfbb218-4ca6-396e-a51b-8e57df499e97",
                                "text": "Let none condemn them [girls] for Rigs, becauſe thus hoiting vvith boys, ſeeing the ſimplicity of their age vvas a Patent to priviledge any innocent paſtime, and fevv mo[r]e years vvill make them bluſh themſelves into better manners."
